  "content": "\n\n<p>JEI/EMI 考古学扩展</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组添加了嗅探器可挖掘物品的查看界面，以及可在可疑沙与可疑砾石中发现的物品的查看界面。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8drp9J9NKE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 链接</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/260/2023-07-20-21_05_26-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"891\" height=\"838\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/261/2023-07-20-21_06_02-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"886\" height=\"836\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252flobstermods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jonn.dk/akliz_banner_archaeology.png\" alt=\"赞助时间\" width=\"830\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
